{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38285","headline":"偶见背面是夕兼梦 · 韩偓","name":"偶见背面是夕兼梦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酥凝背胛玉搓肩，轻薄红绡覆白莲。\n此夜分明来入梦，当时惆怅不成眠。\n眼波向我无端艳，心火因君特地然。\n莫道人生难际会，秦楼鸾凤有神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}